{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huanchen-e-o009","title":"臻数切谏殿舍奏案侵官","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-5776fa83507174eab9fe","label":"正文","text":"臻数切谏殿舍奏案侵官","evidence":["huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0079","role":"数切谏、奏案擅收兰台令史之殿中监、上疏古制侵官之法非恶其勤事也、所益者小所隳者大、臣每察校事类皆如此、惧群司将遂越职以至陵迟","evidence":["huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"方隆意于殿舍、诏曰殿舍不成吾所留心卿推之何","evidence":["huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0","source_order":[22,455,0],"order":4611}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0079","name":"卫臻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-a5d783e869696ae049e0","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-c47f1e02f1725b9a0914","layer":"original","quote":"是时，帝方隆意于殿舍〖15〗，臻数切谏。及殿中监擅收兰台令史〖16〗，臻奏案之〖17〗。诏曰：“殿舍不成，吾所留心。卿推之何〖18〗？”臻上疏曰：“古制侵官之法〖19〗，非恶其勤事也〖20〗；诚以所益者小，所隳者大也〖21〗。臣每察校事〖22〗，类皆如此；惧群司将遂越职，以至陵迟矣","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
